    <CheatEntry>
      <ID>4</ID>
      <Description>"README-1024233 v.0.9.1.2 (2026-05-11)"</Description>
      <VariableType>Auto Assembler Script</VariableType>
      <AssemblerScript>/*

What to do when there is a new version.


Cinder Vault Coordinates (4 bytes):
       Xcoord: 3695
       Ycoord: 1216
       Zcoord: 902

Build Version 1024233 v.0.9.1.2 (2026-05-11)
      X Coordinate: enshrouded.exe+1EEABAA+2
      Z Coordinate: enshrouded.exe+1EEABAA+A
      Y Coordinate: enshrouded.exe+1EEABAA+12


Build Version 893400 (2026-01-26)
      X Coordinate: enshrouded.exe+1D35782+2
      Z Coordinate: enshrouded.exe+1D35782+A
      Y Coordinate: enshrouded.exe+1D35782+12

Build Version 890625
      X Coordinate: enshrouded.exe+1D34782+2
      Z Coordinate: enshrouded.exe+1D34782+A
      Y Coordinate: enshrouded.exe+1D34782+12

Build Version 874630
      X Coordinate: enshrouded.exe+1D2C572+2
      Z Coordinate: enshrouded.exe+1D2C572+A
      Y Coordinate: enshrouded.exe+1D2C572+12

Note:
Be careful when searching for the x/y coordinates.
The camera coordinate is very similar/close to the player position,
The camera coordinates change values when looking around with the camera.

Update LUA script with xyz coordinate addresses

F5 to enable the gps tracking.
Output to file d:\games\enshrouded\gps.txt



*/

[ENABLE]
//code from here to '[DISABLE]' will be used to enable the cheat

 
 
[DISABLE]
//code from here till the end of the code will be used to disable the cheat
</AssemblerScript>
    </CheatEntry>
    <CheatEntry>
      <ID>3</ID>
      <Description>"aob_duplicate"</Description>
      <VariableType>Auto Assembler Script</VariableType>
      <AssemblerScript>[ENABLE]
//code from here to '[DISABLE]' will be used to enable the cheat
/*
Item: 4byte
Find an item in inventory by searching for qty split stack and look for
new qty.

Find what writes to that address while splitting the stack.

*/
aobscanmodule(aob_duplicate,"enshrouded.exe", 5F 5D 5B C3 29 6E 04 EB C5)
registersymbol(aob_duplicate)

aob_duplicate+4:
db 90 90 90

 

/*
enshrouded.exe+341670 - 5F                    - pop rdi
enshrouded.exe+341671 - 5D                    - pop rbp
enshrouded.exe+341672 - 5B                    - pop rbx
enshrouded.exe+341673 - C3                    - ret

enshrouded.exe+341674 - 29 6E 04              - sub [rsi+04],ebp  &lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;

enshrouded.exe+341677 - EB C5                 - jmp enshrouded.exe+34163E
enshrouded.exe+341679 - 0F57 C0               - xorps xmm0,xmm0
enshrouded.exe+34167C - 0F11 47 04            - movups [rdi+04],xmm0
enshrouded.exe+341680 - C6 07 27              - mov byte ptr [rdi],27 { 39 }
enshrouded.exe+341683 - EB C5                 - jmp enshrouded.exe+34164A
*/


[DISABLE]
//code from here till the end of the code will be used to disable the cheat
aob_duplicate+4:
db 29 6E 04

</AssemblerScript>
    </CheatEntry>
    <CheatEntry>
      <ID>368</ID>
      <Description>"Health Regen Rate"</Description>
      <VariableType>Auto Assembler Script</VariableType>
      <AssemblerScript>{ Game   : enshrouded.exe
  Version: 
  Date   : 2026-04-23
  Author : grey_

  This script regenerates health.
}

[ENABLE]

aobscanmodule(aob_health,enshrouded.exe,41 01 04 88 48 8B CB E8 C9) // should be unique
alloc(newmem,$1000,aob_health)

label(code)
label(return)

newmem:
  mov eax,#9999

